msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/get-pro.php:141
msgid "Try Live Demo"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:5
msgid "Is Soft Accordion Responsive?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:6
msgid "Yes, Soft Accordion is fully responsive, ensuring it looks great on all devices, from desktops to mobiles."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:9
msgid "Is Soft Accordion Compatible with Popular Themes?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:10
msgid "Yes, Soft Accordion is fully compatible with popular themes (Divi, Astra, Kadence, Generatepress, and others), ensuring smooth integration and seamless functionality."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:13
msgid "Can I display multiple accordions on one page?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:14
msgid "Yes, you can display multiple accordions on one page!"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:17
msgid "Does this plugin offer FAQ Schema?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:18
msgid "Yes, this plugin offers FAQ Schema support to help your FAQs appear in rich snippets on search engines."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:21
msgid "Can I re-order my FAQ accordions?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:22
msgid "Yes, you can easily re-order your FAQ accordions using a simple drag-and-drop feature."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:25
msgid "Can I customize accordion colors & styles?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:26
msgid "Yes, you can customize the accordion colors and styles to match your site’s design, giving you full control over its look and feel. Also, you can choose our pre-designed templates to fit your design."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:29
msgid "Is there a Gutenberg block to display FAQs?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:30
msgid "A Gutenberg block to display FAQs is coming soon. This new feature will allow you to easily create and customize FAQ sections directly within the Gutenberg editor. You’ll be able to add, organize, and style your FAQs without any hassle, making it simpler to provide helpful information to your website visitors."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:33
msgid "Are the accordions searchable?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:34
msgid "Yes, the accordions are searchable. They include a feature that allows users to search for any content within the accordion, making it easier to find specific information quickly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:37
msgid "Is Soft Accordion Translation Ready?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:38
msgid "Yes, Soft Accordion is translation-ready. This means it is designed to support multiple languages, allowing users to easily translate its content and interface to different languages for a global audience."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:41
msgid "Can I keep the accordion items active on load?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:42
msgid "Yes, you can keep the accordion items active on load. This allows specific items to be opened by default when the page is loaded, providing a better user experience."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:45
msgid "Can I animate the accordions?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:46
msgid "Yes, you can animate the accordions. The accordion items can be animated for smooth transitions, adding a dynamic and engaging effect when they open or close."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:49
msgid "Does Soft Accordion support Shortcode?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:50
msgid "Yes, Soft Accordion supports shortcodes. This feature allows you to easily insert and display accordions anywhere on your site using simple shortcodes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:53
msgid "Is Soft Accordion compatible with the multisite network?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:54
msgid "Yes, Soft Accordion is compatible with multisite networks. It works smoothly across multiple sites within a network, allowing you to use the accordion functionality on all sites without issues."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:57
msgid "Will Soft Accordion slow down my site?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:58
msgid "No, Soft Accordion will not slow down your site. The code is optimized for performance, ensuring that it runs smoothly without affecting your site’s speed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:66
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/index.php:13
msgid "Soft Accordion Logo"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/index.php:16
msgid "Soft Accordion is the ultimate plugin for adding stylish, responsive accordion sections to your WordPress site. Perfect for creating interactive FAQ sections, it helps organize your content in a clean, user-friendly format. Whether you're managing a blog, business site, or eCommerce platform, Soft Accordion ensures your FAQs are displayed beautifully and function seamlessly on any device."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/index.php:37
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/index.php:57
msgid "What's New"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/index.php:82
msgid "Basic Usage"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/index.php:102
msgid "Help"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/index.php:121
msgid "Get Pro"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:5
msgid "Drag & Drop Accordion Sorting"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:6
msgid "Rearranging your accordion items has never been this easy! With the Drag & Drop Accordion Sorting feature, you can effortlessly organize your content with just a simple drag—no coding, no hassle. Whether you're fine-tuning a layout or making quick updates, this feature should be your go-to solution. Say hello to an organized design in no time!"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:9
msgid "Multiple Accordion Event (Click, Mouse Hover & Auto Play)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:10
msgid "Want to make your accordion even more interactive? With Multiple Accordion Events, you can choose how your content unfolds—whether by a simple click, a smooth mouse hover, or an autoplay effect that flows seamlessly. This feature lets you customize your WordPress site’s user experience, offering just the right interaction to surprise your audience."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:13
msgid "Color, Size & Position Customizations"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:14
msgid "With color, size, and position customization, you can make your accordion truly yours! Capture every detail to match your site's style, whether you adjust colors to match your branding, resize for the perfect fit, or reposition for optimal layout. With these customization options, you have full creative control to transform your brand into something alive!"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:17
msgid "20+  Beautiful Premium Themes"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:18
msgid "With 20+ modern premium themes & styles, you'll find the perfect look for your accordion in no time. Each theme is designed to be fully customizable, so you can adjust everything to match your style. Whether you're looking for something professional, bold, or creative, these themes have you covered."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:21
msgid "WooCommerce Product FAQs"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:22
msgid "Make shopping easier for your customers with WooCommerce Product FAQs. By adding a FAQ section to each product, you can quickly address common questions and clear up any uncertainties—right on the product page. This helps your customers feel more confident in their purchase decisions while reducing the need for extra support. It’s a simple way to provide a better shopping experience, build trust, and boost conversions—all in one place!"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:25
msgid "FAQ schema supports"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:26
msgid "FAQ Schema makes your FAQs shine in search results by displaying them directly in rich snippets. This helps potential customers find answers faster, boosting your click-through rates. By structuring your questions and answers with FAQ Schema, you’re not just improving user experience—you’re also giving your SEO a powerful boost."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:37
msgid "Stylish Accordion that Adapts Everywhere"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:39
msgid ""
"Looking for an easy way to add a responsive FAQ accordion to your WordPress site? Meet Soft Accordion, the best accordion plugin for WordPress designed to transform your FAQ section into an eye-catching, interactive experience.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:41
msgid ""
"With Soft Accordion, you can effortlessly create stylish, collapsible FAQs that help your visitors find answers quickly and easily.\n"
"                 "
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:43
msgid "Whether you're building a personal blog, a business site, or an eCommerce platform, this plugin is perfect for organizing your FAQs in a clean, user-friendly format that looks great on any device."
msgstr ""

